# TBCGuide - Blood Elf start: Sunstrider Isle and Eversong Woods (1-11)
# Copyright (C) 2026 GREYsaurus (https://github.com/GREYsaurus) - GPL-3.0-only. Original route and notes.

@guide H_BloodElf_Eversong
@name Sunstrider Isle & Eversong Woods
@faction Horde
@races BloodElf
@levels 1-11
@zone Eversong Woods
@chapter Azeroth
@start
@desc Blood elf starting route (TBC). Sunstrider Isle to about 5, then Falconwing Square, Fairbreeze Village, the Sunsail Anchorage, Stillwhisper Pond and Farstrider Retreat. Continues in the Ghostlands.
@next H_BloodElf_Ghostlands

